cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "SunWind-Quantum-Forecast: Quantum-inspired kernels for solar and wind forecasting across regions"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "SunWind-Quantum-Forecast contributors"
version: "0.1.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23300129"
repository-code: "https://github.com/pavangemmanjunath-cell/SunWind-Quantum-Forecast"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Ongoing experimental research software for comparing classical and
  quantum-inspired kernel forecasting methods across three fixed-parameter
  synthetic renewable-energy scenarios. The results are not validated on
  external observations. The circuit is simulated classically; no quantum
  advantage is claimed.
keywords:
  - renewable energy
  - solar forecasting
  - wind forecasting
  - time series
  - quantum-inspired kernels
